    <mxCell id="c112" value="guest budget exhausted" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#f8cecc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="436" width="150" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="c113" value="0" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#f8cecc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="770" y="436" width="65" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="c114" value="escalate-once applies only when the placer offers a larger class, so the guest budget alone applies.&#10;A compile has no checkpoint flag and resume counter 0, so the task fails and its chain is blocked." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="470" width="815" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="c115" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&#10;guest: plan retries, one per guest failure, no backoff&#10;infra: 10 per task, backoff 10 s doubling to 600 s&#10;none: the task ends at once, never retried&#10;free: nothing charged (operator_interrupt waits for the resume)&#10;oom_killed twice in a row: escalate once, else infra exhausted&#10;schedule_to_start: re-place, timeout doubled to 43200 s&#10;CHECKPOINT_CORRUPT: drop the head of the two kept, none left is ARTIFACT_LOST&#10;ARTIFACT_LOST of a cached component: rebuild once per run&#10;Budgets reset at each resume, kept checkpoints stay&#10;history: 6 per retry (history_events_per_retry), 8 + 6 per rebuild, 0 on end" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="865" y="78" width="460" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
  </root>
</mxGraphModel>
